<h1>icons3d-a (chrome): every picture at 64 px and 24 px on the app ground</h1>
<p>XIM's look: the silhouette filled with a brushed-metal vertical gradient in the product's cool greys (light at the top, dark at the bottom), a thin specular hairline along the top edge, an inner shadow along the bottom edge; monochrome except the concepts that carry a colour in the app (aim's centre dot red, instant and warn amber, ok and on green, record and remove red, the family lights).</p>
<p>Silhouettes: game-icons.net (CC BY 3.0, every author credited in LICENSE) and a few Kenney Input Prompts shapes (CC0). manifest.json maps every name to its source and author. The 24 px sample sits on the page ground; the 64 px sample on a card.</p>
